summary:
  The oldest reading is not dropped when a sixth arrives.

history:
  An entry of six readings is not one the map reads back, so the station
  would stand there with nothing kept of it and be read again at its next
  play.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
  .concat([heard]).slice(-KEEP)], cap);

replace:
  .concat([heard])], cap);

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_five_readings_are_kept_and_a_sixth_takes_the_oldest_ones_place.
  Line-neutral.
